# Generated test vaults.
#
# On 25 Sep a fixture vault's three sealed key shares and its vault seed were
# committed here. The passphrase that opens them is a constant in
# examples/ceremony.rs, so they were shares in name only — anyone with the
# repo held the vault. Testnet, so nothing was lost, but a shared-custody
# product does not keep key shares in its repository under any circumstances.
#
# The fixture is generated on demand now. See scripts/test-coordinator-integration.ts.
packages/core/fixtures/
